<|P>|i|≠|i, |i|v|a|ü|ü|u|Î |k|‡|l|a|m |m|u|t|a|l|i|y|a |m|Â|≠|ü|u|m |n|Â|l|c|e|y|t|‡|r |k|‡|l|a|t|t|u|n|i|k|a|©|n|t|a|≠|a; |‡|k|k|i|y|ù|≠ |p|e|y|a|r |m|u|t|a|l|i|y|a |e|Ò|Ò|u|m |n|Â|l|c|e|y|t|‡|r |k|‡|l|a|t|t|u|m |n|Â|l|v|a|©|a|k|k|u|Ô |k|‡|l|a|t|t|u|m |o|p|p|a |n|i|k|a|©|v|a|≠|a; |i|v|a|i |t|a|m|m|u|Î |v|õ|ü|ü|u|m|a|i.|k|a|©|i|n|t|a|v|a|ü|ü|a|i |u|ı|a|r|t|a|l|‡|l |p|e|r|u|m|p|a|y|a|≠|i|≠|m|a|i|y|i|≠ |a|v|a|i |o|r|u |c|‡|r|‡|ü|k|o|Î|Î|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|≠|a; |‡|k|k|i|y|ù|≠ |p|e|y|a|r |m|u|t|a|l|i|y|a|≠|a |o|r|u|t|a|l|a|i|y|‡|≠ |u|ı|a|r|a|v|õ|ı|Ò|u|t|a|l|i|≠ |a|v|a|i |e|l|l|‡ |‡|c|i|r|i|y|a|r|‡|≠|u|m |k|o|Î|Î|a|p|p|a|Ò|Ò|a|≠|a.

