<|P>|v|a-|ü|u: "|k|‡|ı|‡|≠ |k|a|©|i|t|a|l|u|m |u|ı|Ò|e|≠ |ü|o|r|u|n|‡|Î" (|k|a|l|i. 37.) "|m|ù|y|i|≠|a|Î|u|y|i|r|t|t|a|k|‡|l|a|i" (|a|k|a|m. 5.) "|m|u|k|a|n|t|a|≠|a|r |k|o|Ò|u|p|p|a" (|p|u|ü|a|m. 33.)"|v|i|Î|i|p|p|a|t|u |p|a|y|i|l|u|m |k|u|ü|u|m|p|a|r |t|u|n|t|u|m|i|y|o|Ò|u" (|m|a|l|a|i|p|a|Ò|u. 7.) "|e|r|u|v|i|≠|n|u|ı|t|‡|t|u |k|u|Ò|a|i|v|a|≠|a |‡|Ò|i" (|k|u|ü|u|n. 46.) "|p|e|y|a|r|t|t|a|≠|e|≠ |m|u|y|a|Ô|k|a |y|‡|≠"(|k|u|ü|u|n. 84.) "|m|a|k|k|a|Î|u|Î |i|r|a|Ò|Ò|a|i|y|‡|y |m|‡|ü|i|≠|a|m |p|i|ü|a|n|t|u |y|‡|m" (|y|a|c|ù|t|a|r|a)|e|≠|a|v|u|m, "|c|õ|r|n|t|a|≠|a|i |c|e|≠|m|ù |p|Â|n|t|‡|r |m|‡|r|p|a" (|e|m|m|Â|r|a|l|l|a|t|u |e|≠|≠|u|m|p|a|©|a|m|p|‡|Ò|a|l) "|k|a|r|u|Ô|k|ù|Ò |Ò|i|≠|≠|i|y|a|m |i|y|a|k|k|i|≠|i|r |k|a|©|i|m|i|≠" (|p|e|r|u|m|p|‡|ı.392.) |e|≠|a|v|u|m |m|Â|v|i|Ò|a|t|t|u |a|i|m|p|‡|l|i|≠|u|m |v|i|≠|a|i|m|u|ü|ü|u |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|m|‡|y|i|≠|a."|v|a|r|i|p|u|≠|a|i|v|i|l|l|a|≠ |o|r|u|k|a|ı|a|i |t|e|r|i|n|t|u|k|o|ı|Ò|u" (|a|k|a|m. 48.) "|a|Î|i|n|i|l|a|i|p|e|ü|‡|t|a|m|a|r|i|y|a|m|u|k|a|t|t|a|Î, |v|i|Î|i|n|i|l|a|i|k|o|Î|Î|‡|Î" (|a|k|a|m. 5.) "|u|c|c|i|k|k|Â|p|p|i|y|a|k|a|i|y|i|≠|a|r |t|a|ü|p|u|k|a|©|n|t|u" (|t|i|r|u|m|u|r|u. 185.) "|v|i|©|u|m|i|t|u |k|a|©|i|v|a|t|‡|y|i|≠|u|m"(|k|u|ü|u|n. 253.) "|n|i|l|a|m|i|c|a|i|p |p|u|r|a|Î|u|m |k|a|i|y|a|v|e|y|t|u|y|i|r|t|t|u" (|p|u|ü|a|m. 44.)|e|≠|a|v|u|m, "|t|u|ı|a|i|y|i|≠|n|e|§|c|i|≠|õ|≠ |t|u|y|a|r|u|©|a|n|t|i|≠|a|i|y|õ|≠" (|i-|v|i. |m|õ|ü|k|ù|Î)"|n|„|r|v|‡|r |k|a|ı|ı|õ|m |t|o|©|u|t|u|n|i|ü |p|a|©|i|c|c|i" (|p|u|ü|a|m. 113.) |e|≠|a|v|u|m,"|n|„|r|v|‡|r|k|a|ı|ı|a|i |n|„|y|i|v|a|ı |o|©|i|y|a" (|k|u|ü|u|n. 22.) "|v|e|Î|v|õ|l |v|a|l|a|t|t|i|r |p|o|r|u|Î|t|a|r|a|l |v|õ|Ò|k|a|i|y|i|≠ |u|Î|Î|i|≠|a|r" (|k|a|l|i. 4.) |e|≠|a|v|u|m |m|Â|v|i|Ò|a|t|t|u |a|i|m|p|‡|l|i|≠|u|m|v|i|≠|a|i|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|u|m|u|ü|ü|u |v|i|≠|a|i|y|e|c|c|a|k|k|u|ü|i|p|p|‡|y|i|≠|a. "|v|e|n|t|i|ü|a|l|i|≠|a|≠ |v|i|ü|a|l|v|a|©|u|t|i|y|o|Ò|u" (|i-|v|i. |m|õ|ü|k|ù|Î) "|a|§|c|‡|y|a|l|a|Î |‡|y|i|©|a|i|m|u|≠" "|k|a|Ò|a|ü|ü|‡|≠|a|i|y|a|r|k|a|©|a|l|v|õ|n|t|a|r|a